ation to just be the  beginning of the kinds of questions that  we should be asking and uh answers that  we should be seeking in our own lives  and our own communities  well i appreciate you talking to me  about it you're both terrific in this  everyone is and it's it's just it's  it's frustrating to watch but well done  so thank you  thank you thank you together  yes thanks a lot  you

